#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "轻松创建 USB 启动盘"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "更改语言："

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "想要帮忙改善此翻译吗？"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr "Rufus 是一款格式化和创建 USB 启动盘的辅助工具。"

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "本软件适用于以下场景："

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr "需要将可引导 ISO (Windows、Linux、UEFI 等) 刻录到 USB 安装媒介的情况"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "需要处理未安装操作系统的设备的情况"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "需要在 DOS 环境下刷写 BIOS 或其他固件的情况"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "需要运行低级工具的情况"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr "Rufus 麻雀虽小，但五脏俱全！"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr "本页下方列出了一部分 Rufus 所支持的 ISO 列表。"

#: index.php:276 index.php:328
msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

#: index.php:329
msgid "Latest releases:"
msgstr "最新版本："

#: index.php:332
msgid "Link"
msgstr "链接"

#: index.php:333
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: index.php:334
msgid "Platform"
msgstr "平台"

#: index.php:335
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

#: index.php:336
msgid "Date"
msgstr "日期"

#: index.php:340 index.php:354 index.php:361
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "标准"

#. Abbreviation for MegaByte
#: index.php:342 index.php:349 index.php:356 index.php:363 index.php:371
#: index.php:486
msgid "MB"
msgstr "MB"

#: index.php:347
msgid "Portable"
msgstr "便携版"

#: index.php:369
msgid "BETA"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:376 index.php:377 index.php:481
msgid "Other versions"
msgstr "其他版本"

#: index.php:378
msgid "System Requirements:"
msgstr "系统需求："

#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 或更高版本。"

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "本应用即开即用。"

#: index.php:380
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "支持语言："

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr "我希望借此机会在此表达对 Rufus 及其官方网站的译者的由衷谢意。如果 Rufus 有你的语言，你也应该和我一起感谢他们！"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr "下载后即开即用，无需安装。"

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr "本程序已经经过数字签名，其内容应为："

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 或更高版本)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 及更早版本)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "DOS 支持备注："

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr "如果你创建了 DOS 启动盘，但却未使用美式键盘布局，Rufus 则将会自动根据系统语言选择键盘布局。"

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "ISO 支持备注："

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Rufus 1.1.0 及更高版本支持使用 <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO 镜像</a> (.iso) 文件来创建引导 U 盘。"

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"但从物理光盘或文件中制作 ISO 镜像十分简单，你只需要一款 CD 刻录工具，如免费的 <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>InfraRecorder</a> 或 <a target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>。"

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "常见问题 (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr "您可<b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>在此</a></b>找到 Rufus 的常见问题。"

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"要反馈问题、漏洞或功能请求，请使用 GitHub 的<a target=\"_blank\" %s>议题功能 (Issues)</a>，或<a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>向我发送电子邮件</a>。"

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可协议"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr "<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU 通用许可证第三版 (GPL)</a>或更高版。"

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr "在遵循 GPLv3 许可证的前提下，你可以随意分发、修改，甚至是出售本软件。"

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"从<a target=\"_blank\" %s>开源许可</a>，再到 <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> "
"开发环境，Rufus 的开发流程百分百开源透明。"

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "更新日志"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "源代码"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr "或者，您可以使用以下方法克隆 <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> 存储库："

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr "您可以参见 <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub 项目</a>来了解详情。"

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr "如果您是开发者，我们十分欢迎您为此项目添砖加瓦。"

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "捐助"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr "由于我经常会被问到此问题，所以在此特别声明，本页上<b>无</b>捐助按钮。"

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr "原因之一是，本人觉得捐助系统并不能帮助本软件的开发，甚至会让未捐助的用户背上负罪感。"

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"但如果您执意要捐赠的话，您可以向<a target=\"_blank\" %s>自由软件基金会</a>捐赠。该基金会是促成包括 Rufus "
"在内的开源软件的主要推手之一。"

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr "无论如何，<u>谢谢你</u>对这款小软件的不断支持！"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr "所以不要背上任何没捐赠或没做出贡献的负罪感，尽情随意使用本软件吧！"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Rufus 已知支持的部分 ISO 镜像列表"

